    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29850" root="عقب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقَيِّبٌ</span></b> , with teshdeed of the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>, (O,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقَّيْبٌ</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُبَّيْطٌ</span>, (K,) <i>A certain bird,</i> (O, K,) <i>well
known.</i> (O.) [If the name be correctly as in
the O, the bird meant is probably <i>an eaglet,</i> or <i>a
small species of eagle.</i>]

